    "gtceu.machine.fission_reactor.tooltip.0": "Advanced steam source",
    "gtceu.machine.fission_reactor.tooltip.1": "Though called a pressurized water reactor, it can technically mimic a boiling water reactor.",
    "gtceu.machine.fission_reactor.tooltip.2": "Furthermore, with thorium, it doesn't even need water. The trade-off is low output.",
    "gtceu.machine.hp_steam_turbine.tooltip.0": "Walking alone unto journey's end, the burden weighing heavy.",
    "gtceu.machine.hp_steam_turbine.tooltip.1": "Well, since the GT5u had a turbine like that, I guess it can't be helped.",
    "gtceu.multiblock.ffaithial_prpd_assembly_line.tooltip.0": "Pathos begets Mythos",
    "gtceu.multiblock.ffaithial_prpd_assembly_line.tooltip.1": "Assembler, Circuit Assembler, Assembly Line.",
    "gtceu.multiblock.ffaithial_prpd_assembly_line.tooltip.2": "The integrated «Power» will now become a Divine Vessel.",
    "gtceu.multiblock.ffaithial_prpd_assembly_line.tooltip.3": "(When the world comes crumbling down, know I'll be there)",
    "gtceu.multiblock.ffaithial_prpd_assembly_line.tooltip.4": "(Through out fleeting moment has gone, You're not--you're not alone YEAH)",
    "gtceu.multiblock.ffaithial_prpd_assembly_line.tooltip.5": "(As you turn your eyes to the stars: Oh, I'll be there)",
    "gtceu.multiblock.ffaithial_prpd_assembly_line.tooltip.6": "(With my chorus guiding you, forge ahead)",
    "gtceu.multiblock.hp_pyrolyse_oven.tooltip.0": "An overwhelming efficiency advantage",
